            content: [
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: '99 (adding game): play cards to a central pile; A=1 or 11, 2-9=face, 10=-10, J/Q=0, K=99 or reset. Avoid exceeding 99; first to push over loses. Similar to 98. USA/UK.',
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Origin: USA and United Kingdom\nHistorical development: The game has evolved over time in its regions of origin.\nCultural significance: 99 holds cultural importance in both the USA and the UK.',
